  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1302.15 “School related activity” is an event or sports activity involving pupils, to include intramural events, sponsored or approved by a public school, school district, school board, or school administrative unit.\n\nSource. #8248, eff 1-4-05 (from Saf-C 1302.14); ss by #10439, eff 10-11-13 (formerly Saf-C 1302.17) (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1300); ss by #14005, eff 6-22-24, EXPIRES: 6-22-34 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1300)",
